          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_lonely_short_002_02",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "私は今、少し近くにいるつもりでいる。大げさじゃなく、ちゃんと。",
          "displayText": "Right now, I am trying to be a little closer. Not dramatically. Properly.",
