          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "id": "player_lonely_short_002_04",
          "speaker": "alterra",
          "text": "ただ同じ場所にいる、みたいな時間も私は好きだよ。少し照れるけど。",
          "displayText": "I like time that is just being in the same place. It embarrasses me a little, though.",
